Zone TrackFXMenu
        /  DisplayUpper|         FXMenuNameDisplay
        /  DisplayLower|         FXBypassDisplay
        RotaryBig               NoAction
        RotaryBigPush           ShowFXSlot
        RotaryBigPush           GoFXSlot
        Mute                 ToggleFXBypass
        /Prev                  TrackFXMenuBank -1
        /Next                 TrackFXMenuBank 1
ZoneEnd
